e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=DCeFX8MO7ZUQ7kNvwGEa9Uh&_nc_oc=Adr1rG8yJ8hTvcvzCeAxyF2o_2yWGOCR_FZGMNVMPpDmZxE2v-DU9uv3QId5Q4qDIdE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTeVcn94L08Q-tRBuJIl2b2H9bo1rMEwHrrRrxL2Ch_YA&oe=6AE9F8F9"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ARcZAb7q3dMQ7kNvwEg9ZN2&_nc_oc=Adr4DKBClKHb35968tqSNVyyBorgSjIQ7-vNtrqSZhO-0ls7ksBBr6r1WOQdNgXZqyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQWttEMfjV8hwTI3xnIA1fkMzIzVDAzR_-MwywmornjmQ&oe=6AEA0893"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lUGk0nvBP-QQ7kNvwEAeLTZ&_nc_oc=AdpGPfcvAXGmL0JjGrrhGm_NbHOyqrZEKwhuKuetRil3pUJqvUXVUXwk9kLXshwaaXQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQS7EDayGi0-d2xgH8AejDWvNmjFPwlNJFJ-2vthD6Qm7A&oe=6AEA143B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=GTHUeIJB_gEQ7kNvwFsOpJb&_nc_oc=AdpEuyZf25lGS3ErmCW7dx8cdZ_6eES7HrGr6UiofjgTUftMtgm4hVOPCE8tuGL20l4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTPAGY1Jb8h99M474E81saNVQIxX-ewVW9zpMYW-NuI9w&oe=6AEA158A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OJIeV6QzE3UQ7kNvwG_hR-P&_nc_oc=AdqNrhUE0fLPFp6Q6AxJlO9g6jD0fJyHMJZvJdEVzqF851dLQs0_DvAiLgS_HPQo9w0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRFe70PNY68e7StYW6aMLupNM-ArPT55QqL-iiCp-aGOw&oe=6AE9FEBE"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se